  "title": "Gekijouban Free! Timeless Medley",
  "justification": "AniDB special S8 (2017-07-01) has no TVDB episode, was 0x08. AniDB dates from the AniDB mirror at 7dd9b8e; TVDB from its official order. AniDB specials S1-S4 \"Kizuna: Character Butai Aisatsu Eizou 1-4\" (2017-04-22) and S5-S8 \"Yakusoku: Character Butai Aisatsu Eizou 1-4\" (2017-07-01) are the films' stage-greeting clips. S1-S7 fell by default on TVDB season 0 episodes 1-7, the 2013 FrFr! shorts of AniDB 9858. TVDB lists no greeting clips, so all eight are unmapped. The two films stay on season 0 episodes 10 and 11 \"Timeless Medley 1: The Bond\" and \"2: The Promise\". AniDB special S8 (2017-07-01) has no TVDB episode, was 0x08. AniDB dates from the AniDB mirror at 7dd9b8e; TVDB from its official order. AniDB 12332's specials S1 to S8 are the stage-greeting videos of the Timeless Medley screenings (2017-04-22 and 2017-07-01); none is on TVDB season 0 or TMDB 61456 season 0 (E1 to E9: the FrFr! shorts, Forbidden All Hard! and Buildup of Early Spring!). The PR 629 row already sends S8 to no TVDB episode; the others still default onto 0x1 to 0x7 and, on TMDB, S0E1 to S0E8, which belong to AniDB 9858, 10415 and 13548. The rows send S1 to S8 to no episode on both sides.",
